# On the Shoulders of Giants: "Historic creatures you control have flying" (CR 700.6, 702.9). Bot1 casts it on turn 1 off
# Black Lotus, then Memnite (an artifact creature) and Isamaru, Hound of Konda (a legendary creature), the two ways a
# creature is historic, alongside Fugitive Wizard, a creature that is not. Bot2 casts its own Memnite, an artifact
# creature it controls. On turn 3 Bot1 attacks with all three: Bot2's Memnite may not block the legendary attacker, and
# the two historic creatures get through, while Bot2's historic creature has no flying and Bot1's non-historic Wizard has
# none either (the "you control" and "historic" limits). On turn 5 the Wizard attacks alone and Bot2's Memnite blocks
# it - the same blocker refused the flying creature, so it is the grant that stops the block, not the creature.

[Bot1 Deck]
On the Shoulders of Giants
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Memnite
Isamaru, Hound of Konda
Fugitive Wizard
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.On the Shoulders of Giants.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Isamaru, Hound of Konda.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Fugitive Wizard.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = Flying
? Bot1.Battlefield.Isamaru, Hound of Konda.Keywords = Flying
? Bot1.Battlefield.Fugitive Wizard.Keywords = (absent)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Keywords = (absent)
? Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = (absent)
Bot1.Attack(Memnite; Isamaru, Hound of Konda; Fugitive Wizard > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.DeclareBlockers]
! Bot2.Block(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite > Bot1.Battlefield.Isamaru, Hound of Konda)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Life = 16
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Fugitive Wizard > Bot2)
[T5 Bot1.DeclareBlockers]
Bot2.Block(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite > Bot1.Battlefield.Fugitive Wizard)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Life = 16

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = Flying
Bot1.Battlefield.Isamaru, Hound of Konda.Keywords = Flying
Bot1.Battlefield.Fugitive Wizard = (absent)
Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite = (absent)
